docs {
  # Confirm Presigned Upload (Protected)

  **Method:** `POST`
  **Endpoint:** `/api/v1/attachments/confirm-upload`
  **Auth:** Required (Bearer Token)

  ## Description

  Invoked by the client after completing the direct `PUT` upload to storage. The backend verifies that the object exists in RustFS, queries its exact size and ETag, and registers the metadata record into the PostgreSQL database.

  ## Request

  ### Headers

  | Field | Type | Required | Description |
  | --- | --- | --- | --- |
  | `Authorization` | `string` | Yes | Bearer access token (`Bearer <token>`) |
  | `Content-Type` | `string` | Yes | `application/json` |

  ### Body

  | Field | Type | Required | Description |
  | --- | --- | --- | --- |
  | `object_key` | `string` | Yes | Object storage key returned by `presigned-upload` |
  | `original_filename` | `string` | Yes | Original file name |
  | `type` | `string` | Yes | Attachment type |
  | `group_id` | `int64` | No | Associated squad/group ID |
  | `expense_id` | `int64` | No | Associated expense ID |
  | `is_public` | `boolean` | No | Public accessibility flag |

  ## Response

  **`201 Created`**
  ```json
  {
    "success": true,
    "data": {
      "id": 2,
      "uploaded_by_user_id": 1,
      "type": "GROUP_COVER",
      "original_filename": "squad_cover.jpg",
      "object_key": "attachments/group_cover/2026/11/abc123_squad_cover.jpg",
      "mime_type": "image/jpeg",
      "file_size_bytes": 2097152,
      "is_public": true,
      "access_url": "http://127.0.0.1:9000/doratou-storage/attachments/group_cover/2026/11/abc123_squad_cover.jpg"
    }
  }
  ```

  ## Errors

  * `400 Bad Request` — Missing required fields
  * `401 Unauthorized` — Missing or invalid Bearer token
  * `404 Not Found` — Object does not exist in storage (upload failed or wrong key)
}
